    "summary": "gather.relationCall for quality and adherence: a cut 'calls' relation is judged once, both full rows in one call when they fit, else two calls each one full row against the other's neighbour summary; every returned call is measured against the limit (or the refused size) and a row that does not fit even so is named by AtomTooLargeError, never cut (fix 3817b7b4). A mismatch must be located at the caller: gather.validate accepts only the caller's file and only the two symbols as counterpart, with fixed-size reasons; re-issued once, then the review fails.",
